Approach: Use nested loops to generate all subarrays, keep adding elements to sum, and count when sum equals goal (break early if sum exceeds goal).

Time Complexity: O(n²) — two nested loops for all subarrays.

Space Complexity: O(1) — no extra data structures used.

class Solution {
    public int numSubarraysWithSum(int[] nums, int goal) {
        return subarray(nums,goal)-subarray(nums,goal-1);
